Regretablement, le chasset will be at
least another half hour before he's done.

193
00:10:38,660 --> 00:10:40,217
It'll be far too late by then.

194
00:10:40,300 --> 00:10:42,712
We can't allow her to destroy the castle.

195
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,070
Mama!

196
00:10:51,153 --> 00:10:52,320
You must stop this!

197
