This is a nightmare!

235
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:58,240
Run for your lives!

236
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,940
No one can stop her now!

237
00:14:05,780 --> 00:14:08,180
What a tragic state of affairs.

238
00:14:15,140 --> 00:14:18,997
Somebody's coming down
the river of juice is that

239
