253
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:37,440
If I'm delicious, then I can die happy!

254
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,260
Thank you, boss.

255
00:15:40,560 --> 00:15:41,660
You saved us.

256
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,228
I'll give the chefs a call.

257
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,800
The crisis is over.

258
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:48,961
We must summon all the ministers.

259
00:15:49,220 --> 00:15:51,817
Rest our lack of a daily
time for the big tea party!

260
