properly for bringing me that poneglyph.

263
00:16:05,540 --> 00:16:07,220
Only wish I could read it.

264
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,440
Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma.

265
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:15,120
